<string name="sync_architecture_title">Local-first sync</string>
<string name="sync_architecture_body">Every phone writes only its own hidden sync snapshot in Drive appDataFolder. On sync, HOMIQ downloads all device snapshots, merges UUID records and tombstones, updates Room in one transaction, then publishes the merged state back to this phone file. No HOMIQ server is required.</string>
